[00:20.92]1. The living and true God—
[00:24.92]The God of all creation
[00:29.96]In ev’ry generation—
[00:35.00]Jehovah is your name.
[00:40.41]We’re honored and we’re proud
[00:45.41]To be your congregation.
[00:50.41]In ev’ry tribe and nation,
[00:55.41]Your glory we proclaim.
[00:57.91](Chorus)
[01:00.41]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:05.61]There is no God like you.
[01:10.05]There’s no other in the heavens
[01:15.81]Or on the earth below.
[01:20.41]You alone are God Almighty,
[01:25.77]And this all men must know.
[01:31.20]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[01:36.20]We have no other God but you.
[01:51.84]2. You cause us to become
[01:56.68]Whatever you desire,
[02:01.53]To do as you require—
[02:06.49]Jehovah is your name.
[02:11.53]And Witnesses for you
[02:16.57]Is what you’ve kindly named us.
[02:21.69]We’re honored you have claimed us—
[02:26.73]A people for your name.
[02:29.35](Chorus)
[02:31.96]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[02:36.82]There is no God like you.
[02:41.38]There’s no other in the heavens
[02:46.70]Or on the earth below.
[02:51.18]You alone are God Almighty,
[02:56.68]And this all men must know.
[02:59.39]Jehovah, Jehovah,
[03:02.11]We have no other God but you.